    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d413-a1">

                <pb facs="0958" n="862" xml:id="pg862"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 320.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gibbs to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1879-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 12, 1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: By the Commereio, of this day’s date, I see
                    that it reports that the Chilian steamer Itata entered the port of Callao under
                    the flag of the United States of America.</p>
                <p>You will please inquire into the truth of this statement and report as soon as
                    possible to this legation.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>RICHARD GIBBS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
